<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian 10-yr bonds hemed in at 93.470.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian 10-yr bonds hemed in at 93.470.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>FUTURES     *SUP-RES	 *2ND SUP-RES   *3RD SUP-RES   *RSI</p>
<p>10-YEAR(SEP)*93.410-93.470 *93.360-93.520 *93.310-93.570 *54.98Z 3-YEAR (SEP)*94.31-94.36   *94.27-94.41   *94.21-94.46   *61.43</p>
<p>90-DAY (SEP)*95.18-95.25   *95.12-95.27   *95.08-95.30   *72.12</p>
<p>-----------------------(Aug 18)--------------------------------</p>
<p>*The Australian 10-year bond futures contract is expected to find difficulty extending last week's strong rebound and through 93.470 with external factors limiting the advance.</p>
<p>*U.S. Treasuries ended Friday mixed against a backdrop of a falling U.S. dollar and a 247-point slump in the Dow Jones Industrial Average</p>
